  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> The sling bullet shatters your midfoot, making a mess of the complicated puzzle of tarsal bones in that part of the foot. Tendons and nerves are also ravaged. If the sling bullet was a Lead Bullet it actually penetrates all the way through to your sole! Regardless, your foot is a ruin.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> You gain @Condition[Stunned] (2) and @Condition[Prone]. You also permanently lose function in the foot – Amputation (Challenging).</p>"
    },
